<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-TRANSVAAL BEAT FREE STATE 24-20.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-TRANSVAAL BEAT FREE STATE 24-20.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN, South Africa 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transvaal beat Free State 24-20 (half-time 10-6) in their Super 12 match at Free State stadium on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Transvaal - Tries: Hannes Strydom, Gavin Johnson. Conversion: Johnson. Penalties: Johnson, Johan Roux (3).</p>
<p>Free State - Tries: Andre Venter, Stephen Brink. Conversions: M.J.Smith (2). Penalties: M.J.Smith (2).</p>
</text>
